.TH AVR\-FIREWALL\-SET\-DEFAULT 1 "" "avr" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-firewall-set-default \- Set the default action, or use --inherit with --repo to restore organization inheritance.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr firewall set-default
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set the default action, or use --inherit with --repo to restore organization inheritance.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified.
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fITEXT\fR
Repository ID or owner/repo. If provided, sets the repo-level default.
.TP
\fB\-\-action\fR \fICHOICE\fR
(choices: allow, deny)
.TP
\fB\-\-inherit\fR
Remove the repository default override.
.SH SEE ALSO
